Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.00,0:01:41.10,Title,0,0,0,0,,《生化危机：惩罚》
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.93,0:04:25.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫爱丽丝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Alice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.14,0:04:28.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,曾为保护伞公司工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I worked for the Umbrella Corporation, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.35,0:04:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是全世界最强大的商业实体{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the largest and most powerful commercial entity in the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.27,0:04:35.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾在称作蜂巢的某秘密科研所负责安保工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was head of security at a secret high-tech facility called the Hive, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.19,0:04:41.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一个开发生化武器的大型地下实验室{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}a giant underground laboratory developing experimental, viral weaponry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.61,0:04:44.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,但出了事故{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was an incident.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.11,0:04:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,病毒外逸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A virus escaped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.82,0:04:50.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,死了很多人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot of people died.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.95,0:04:55.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,可问题是…他们还没死透{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The trouble was, they didn't stay dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.88,0:05:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,控制蜂巢的计算机具备最尖端的人工智能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The computer that controlled the Hive was a state-of-the-art artificial intelligence:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.01,0:05:03.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,她叫红后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Red Queen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.13,0:05:10.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,红后对病毒的扩散做出了极端应对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Red Queen responded to the threat of the viral outbreak in an extreme way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.22,0:05:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,她大开杀戒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She went homicidal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.77,0:05:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们全得死在里面 - 红后要杀死每一个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're all going to die down here. - The Red Queen attempted to kill everyone!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.60,0:05:19.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不论是否感染{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whether they were infected or not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.11,0:05:26.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我成功逃脱 但事情远未结束{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I managed to escape, but this was only the beginning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.24,0:05:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,病毒如野火般迅速传播{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Viral outbreaks spread like wildfire, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.70,0:05:37.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,先是横扫美国 接着是全世界…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}first across the United States, then the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.63,0:05:42.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,然而 T病毒不仅能让死人复生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The T-Virus didn't just bring the dead back to life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.92,0:05:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,还使其恐怖地变异{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It mutated them in terrifying ways.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.63,0:05:49.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了天启之外{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Despite the apocalypse they had created, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.93,0:05:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护伞公司还实验了其它致命病毒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Umbrella Corporation continued to experiment with the deadly virus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.10,0:05:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也被感染{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was infected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.81,0:05:59.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,但病毒却从细胞层面与我结合{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the virus bonded with me on a cellular level.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.15,0:06:02.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拥有了超能力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I developed powers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.53,0:06:05.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的遗传结构就是关键{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your genetic structure is the key.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.74,0:06:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,变得与众不同{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I became different.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.07,0:06:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,所向披靡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Powerful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.87,0:06:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,势不可挡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unstoppable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.33,0:06:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我愈加强大 人类却日渐孱弱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As I got stronger, the human race became weaker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.54,0:06:22.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我尽力把幸存者带到安全地点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried my best to lead what survivors I could find to safety, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.34,0:06:24.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们却被无情追杀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we were pursued relentlessly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.84,0:06:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,连我的朋友吉尔·瓦伦丁也被保护伞抓住洗脑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even my friend Jill Valentine was seized and brainwashed by Umbrella.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.22,0:06:29.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,下令射杀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot to kill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.80,0:06:32.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,最终 我遭遇保护伞公司掌门人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finally, I confronted the head of the Umbrella Corporation, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.10,0:06:35.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿尔伯特·威斯克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Albert Wesker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.35,0:06:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他夺走了我的超能力 但我依然将其击败{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He robbed me of my powers, but I still managed to defeat him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.77,0:06:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后 我们以为一切都已结束{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}At last, we thought it was over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.32,0:06:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,以为我们已经逃离劫难{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We thought we had survived the horror.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.86,0:06:51.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果我们错了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we were wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.91,0:06:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们仍需为求生而战{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once again, we found ourselves fighting for our lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.88,0:07:07.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,快快快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.14,0:08:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,快起床啦 宝贝 我们晚了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rise and shine. Come on, babe. We're late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.48,0:08:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,闹钟没响{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The alarm didn't go off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.57,0:08:10.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝姬还没起床{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Becky's not up yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.82,0:08:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,安德森老师肯定要生气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Henderson's gonna be pissed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.53,0:08:17.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也知道 送她上学迟到会怎样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know how they get when you drop her off late at the school.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.08,0:08:27.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝 你还好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Babe? You all right, babe?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.55,0:08:29.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.05,0:08:33.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去叫贝姬{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go get Becky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.51,0:08:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我帮你充了电{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I charged your batteries for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.52,0:08:45.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝姬 你也知道安德森老师…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Becky, you know Miss Henderson, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.77,0:08:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你边打手语边说出声来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}she wants you to speak while you sign.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.82,0:08:50.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢爸爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Daddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.82,0:08:56.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,等你从学校回来 我给你个惊喜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you come back from school, I have a surprise for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.53,0:08:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听到啦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.53,0:09:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,电池越来越不经用了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These batteries are lasting less and less.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.87,0:09:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,得买些新的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to get some new ones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.37,0:09:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我可以回家时带几块 - 我又要迟到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can pick some up on my way home. - I'm gonna be late again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.38,0:09:10.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw, shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.63,0:09:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去睡房帮你再找件衬衫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get you another shirt from the bedroom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.76,0:09:16.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨天有人帮你取干洗了哦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone picked up your dry-cleaning yesterday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.43,0:09:19.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可真是我的小天使{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are my little angel, aren't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.68,0:09:21.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是要迟到了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna be late, remember?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.64,0:09:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.56,0:09:27.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去帮你拿衬衫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heh. I'll get you that shirt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.48,0:09:30.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护贝姬{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get Becky back! Aah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.28,0:09:34.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.20,0:09:39.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.79,0:09:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命 救命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help! Help us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.51,0:09:59.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.89,0:10:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.07,0:10:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.26,0:11:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.64,0:11:26.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.20,0:11:41.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 退后 - 等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Back! - Wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.16,0:11:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等等 - 别过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait! - Stay back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.58,0:11:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你脑子有毛病啊？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is wrong with you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.87,0:11:50.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点上车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, get in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.43,0:12:08.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.89,0:12:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你问我 我问谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your guess is as good as mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.27,0:12:11.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些人怎么这样啊？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are these people doing this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.48,0:12:14.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们不能叫人了 不是人了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those things are not people. Not any…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.04,0:12:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你受伤了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you hurt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.80,0:12:45.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,还能动吗？好样的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you move? Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.15,0:12:57.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.86,0:13:06.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.62,0:13:16.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.42,0:13:17.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.58,0:13:18.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.25,0:14:04.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.65,0:15:48.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,生化人爱丽丝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Project Alice, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.86,0:15:51.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么背叛公司？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}why did you turn against Umbrella?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.11,0:15:53.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉尔？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jill?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.99,0:15:55.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.41,0:15:57.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,生化人爱丽丝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Project Alice, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.54,0:16:00.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么背叛公司？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}why did you turn against Umbrella?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.58,0:16:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,克里斯和克莱尔怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to Chris and Claire?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.21,0:16:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,船上其他人呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are the others from the ship?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.35,0:16:24.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,生化人爱丽丝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Project Alice, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.85,0:16:27.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为谁工作？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}who do you work for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.19,0:16:31.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,生化人爱丽丝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Project Alice, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.03,0:16:35.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为谁工作？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}who do you work for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.57,0:16:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉尔 你为什么这么做？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jill, why are you doing this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.85,0:17:06.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,警告 警告{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Warning. Warning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.65,0:17:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,非法计算机入侵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unauthorized computer access.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.15,0:17:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全系统失效{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Security system disabled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.44,0:17:16.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,中央计算机2分钟后重启{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Central computer reboot in two minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.37,0:17:20.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全系统失效{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Security system disabled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.33,0:17:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,中央计算机1分50秒后重启{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Central computer reboot in one minute, 50 seconds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.21,0:17:31.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全系统失效{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Security system disabled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.50,0:17:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,中央计算机1分40秒后重启{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Central computer reboot in one minute 40 seconds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.01,0:17:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全系统失效{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Security system disabled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.31,0:17:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,中央计算机30秒后重启{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Central computer reboot in 30 seconds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.77,0:17:49.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全系统失效{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Security system disabled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.98,0:17:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,中央计算机20秒后重启{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Central computer reboot in 20 seconds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.99,0:17:57.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全系统失效{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Security system disabled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.36,0:18:02.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,中央计算机10秒后重启{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Central computer reboot in 10 seconds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.49,0:18:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,中央计算机重启中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Central computer rebooting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.63,0:18:19.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,安保全体集合{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scramble all security teams.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.80,0:18:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,镭射网刀清除走廊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And sweep the corridor with the laser grid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.39,0:19:43.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,已就绪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand by.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.01,0:19:47.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,已就绪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand by.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.10,0:19:53.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,东京序列启动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tokyo sequence initialized.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.86,0:24:49.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,已就绪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand by.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.44,0:24:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,已就绪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand by.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.83,0:25:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎进入保护伞控制中心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to Umbrella Central Control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.10,0:25:28.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才对嘛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.92,0:25:54.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.17,0:25:55.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我叫… - 艾达·王{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My name is… - Ada Wong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.13,0:25:59.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护伞公司特勤人员 威斯克手下明星特工{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Operative for the Umbrella Corporation, one of Albert Wesker's top agents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.01,0:26:03.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的底细我清楚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know exactly who and what you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.93,0:26:05.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在最大的问题是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, the real question is:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.98,0:26:08.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么我不立刻杀了你？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't I just cancel your contract right now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.73,0:26:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不再为保护伞工作了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't work for Umbrella anymore, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.86,0:26:14.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿尔伯特·威斯克也一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and neither does Albert Wesker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.36,0:26:15.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不管{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.78,0:26:17.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以杀了她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can kill her if you like, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.70,0:26:20.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,但真相也将石沉大海{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but then you'll never get out of this place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.28,0:26:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 威斯克 - 现在乖一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wesker. - Now, be a good girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.70,0:26:24.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,把刀放下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put down the knife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.54,0:26:27.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱丽丝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Alice, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.37,0:26:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,真高兴见到你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}how nice to see you again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.38,0:26:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,她怎么逃的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did she get out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.92,0:26:33.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然有帮手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's obviously getting help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.88,0:26:36.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定有内奸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a traitor in this facility.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.63,0:26:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,小姐 安全系统关闭了2分钟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Security systems were shut down for two minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.22,0:26:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 控制中心呢？ - 无法唤醒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What about Control? - We still can't raise them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.60,0:26:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,控制中心所有人均已被我杀死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I executed everyone in this control room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.98,0:26:51.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让威斯克黑掉主机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I enabled Wesker to hack the mainframe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.31,0:26:54.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,关闭了安全系统{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We shut down the security systems.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.32,0:26:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮你逃出羁押室{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We let you out of that cell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.07,0:26:59.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要设法让你离开这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to get you out of this facility.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.24,0:27:02.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们为什么要帮我？ - 我们需要你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So why do you want to help me? - We need you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.49,0:27:04.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类濒于灭绝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The human race faces extinction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.08,0:27:08.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,合作是我们最后一线生机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our only hope of survival is for us to work together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.79,0:27:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我绝不离开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not going anywhere{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.17,0:27:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到弄清这是哪里 这里发生了什么事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}until I know where we are and what the hell is going on here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.09,0:27:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在保护伞的核心实验基地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're in the Prime Umbrella testing facility.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.67,0:27:18.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,东京是怎么回事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Explain Tokyo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.63,0:27:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到的只不过是个逼真复制{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you saw was just a detailed re-creation, nothing more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.10,0:27:27.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就几个街区{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It goes on for a few city blocks. That's all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.56,0:27:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我在室外{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was outside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.23,0:27:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.73,0:27:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到天空了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saw the sky, did you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.56,0:27:35.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 当时是晚上 - 星星呢？月亮呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It was night. - Stars? The moon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.98,0:27:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,实验平台高300英尺 天花板是黑色的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The testing floor is 300 feet high, the ceiling black.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.36,0:27:43.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以总是晚上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's usually night in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.28,0:27:46.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,僵尸不就喜欢晚上出来吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But isn't that when the monsters come out anyway?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.29,0:27:48.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 当时在下雨 - 气候控制{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It was raining. - Climate control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.66,0:27:50.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,风 雨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wind, rain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.83,0:27:53.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,下点雪也未尝不可{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can even make it snow if they want to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.46,0:27:55.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么造这个地方？ - 很简单{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why build such a place? - Simple.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.92,0:27:58.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护伞公司的核心利润{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Umbrella Corporation derived its primary income{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.92,0:28:00.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,来自于生化武器销售{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}from the sale of viral weaponry, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.09,0:28:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,而这无法在真实世界测试{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}something that's impossible to test in the real world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.68,0:28:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们复制了纽约市中心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They re-created the center of New York, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.22,0:28:10.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,模拟病毒爆发 向俄方买家演示{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}simulated an outbreak, showed it to the Russians, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.31,0:28:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,出售其病毒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and sold them the virus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.60,0:28:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,同样 他们模拟莫斯科病毒爆发 然后卖给美国人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They simulated an outbreak in Moscow, sold it to the Americans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.98,0:28:18.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有东京的爆发{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}An outbreak in Tokyo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.65,0:28:19.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后卖给中国人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sold it to the Chinese.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.15,0:28:23.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 再演示中国的爆发 - 然后卖给日本人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- An outbreak in China. - Sold it to the Japanese.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.24,0:28:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 所以各国都得购买{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly. Everyone had to have it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.87,0:28:29.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护伞公司引发了新一轮军备竞赛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Umbrella Corporation built a new arms race.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.95,0:28:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是这次生化武器取代了核武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only, this time, it was biological rather than nuclear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.79,0:28:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,暴利经营{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Highly profitable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.75,0:28:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是一切的源头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this is where it all happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.17,0:28:41.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是保护伞公司的杰作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Umbrella's greatest creation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.72,0:28:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是最险峻的要害命门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The belly of the beast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.84,0:28:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们还不离开这个鬼地方？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why don't we just get the hell out of here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.26,0:28:49.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.31,0:28:53.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,日出不到一分钟了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sunup is in less than a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.89,0:28:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己来看看吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you just see for yourself?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.02,0:29:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个基地位于俄罗斯北部{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This facility is located in the straits of Kamchatka, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.78,0:29:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,堪察加峡湾 八十年代{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}northern Russia. The old Soviet Union{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.03,0:29:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,前苏联曾在此建有潜艇船坞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}built submarine pens here in the '80s.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.07,0:29:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷战结束后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}After the Cold War ended, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.41,0:29:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护伞公司将其扩建为实验平台{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Umbrella Corporation expanded them, and built the testing floor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.96,0:29:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,从未有人从这里逃走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one has ever escaped from this facility.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.22,0:29:24.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,冰壳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.88,0:29:27.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得尽量寻求帮助{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll need all the help you can get, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.22,0:29:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我准备了一支突击队从地面进入基地协助你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I've arranged for a strike team to enter from the surface and assist you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.06,0:30:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里就是保护伞实验基地的入风口{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There they are. Intake vents for the Umbrella facility.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.07,0:30:24.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,像是已经废弃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks abandoned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.53,0:30:26.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就希望别人这么想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what they want you to think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.70,0:30:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 我们只有2小时来救出爱丽丝和艾达{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's move. We have just two hours to extract Alice and Ada.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.07,0:30:34.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则便可能遭遇保护伞重火力后援部队{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}After that, we can expect heavy Umbrella reinforcements.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.88,0:30:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,开启旁路模式{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Running a bypass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.43,0:30:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是艾达给我们的进入密码{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are the codes from Ada.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.89,0:30:55.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你相信她吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you trust her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.89,0:30:57.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,输入就是了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just enter the numbers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.07,0:31:04.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,爆炸量设置完毕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The charges are set.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.07,0:31:09.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,进去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.55,0:31:27.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,大干一场吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.30,0:31:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.01,0:31:33.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,突击队驻守了一部升降机 确保你们能逃上地面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The strike team has secured an elevator for your escape to the surface.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.76,0:31:35.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会消灭保护伞的抵抗力量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will eliminate Umbrella resistance, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.89,0:31:37.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后与我们会合{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}then rendezvous with us, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.56,0:31:38.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,护送我们出去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and escort us out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.10,0:31:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有个朋友也在里面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have a friend of yours with them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.69,0:31:43.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢瑟·韦斯特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luther West.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.36,0:31:44.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还活着吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's alive?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.27,0:31:48.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓紧了 女士们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Hold on, ladies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.28,0:31:58.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,对表 两小时计时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Synchronize watches. Two hours exactly in{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.00,0:32:01.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,3 2 1 开始{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}three, two, one, mark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.46,0:32:09.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,里昂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leon, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.80,0:32:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不用遥控引爆？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}why don't we trigger remotely?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.18,0:32:14.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,防止对方信号干扰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't risk them jamming the signal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.64,0:32:18.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不论我们成功与否 都要炸毁这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And whether we succeed or not, this facility has to be destroyed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.50,0:32:22.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果两小时搞不定怎么办？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if we take longer than two hours?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.20,0:32:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你最好很能憋气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I hope you're really good at holding your breath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.73,0:32:30.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,安保主管瓦伦丁已到达东京测试环境{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Security Chief Valentine has reached the Tokyo test environment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.90,0:32:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是来抓你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's tracking you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.95,0:32:34.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们朝这里来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're headed this way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.20,0:32:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的命令是能抓就抓{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her orders are to recapture you, if possible, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.58,0:32:41.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓不到就杀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}terminate you if necessary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.41,0:32:43.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁下的命令？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's giving these orders?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.37,0:32:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,红后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Red Queen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.67,0:32:46.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那台计算机吗？ - 对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The computer? - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.71,0:32:50.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是蜂巢那种人工智能机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The same artificial intelligence you encountered in the Hive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.38,0:32:53.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在她控制了保护伞公司的余孽{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She now controls what remains of the Umbrella Corporation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.88,0:32:57.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝不会放你逃出这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She will stop at nothing to prevent you escaping to the surface.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.93,0:33:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我绘制了一幅逃生线路图{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've plotted an escape route for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.35,0:33:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们穿过纽约测试环境{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll cross the New York environment to Suburbia{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.27,0:33:05.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,在郊区与突击队会合{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}where you'll rendezvous with the strike team.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.65,0:33:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会护送你们穿过莫斯科实验环境{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll escort you through the Moscow environment, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.69,0:33:10.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,直达潜艇船坞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the submarine pens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.86,0:33:13.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后乘升降机回到地面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And take the elevator back to the surface.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.49,0:33:15.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,红后已开始截获信号{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Red Queen has intercepted my signal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.16,0:33:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上会夺回基地控制权{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's about to regain control of this facility.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.24,0:33:20.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要快 我不能再…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must hurry. I can't…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.95,0:33:24.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,别听背叛者威斯克的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't listen to the traitor Wesker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.42,0:33:27.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在由我掌控{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am in control now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.10,0:33:29.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,生化人爱丽丝 艾达·王{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Project Alice, Ada Wong, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.54,0:33:30.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,待着别动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}stay where you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.25,0:33:33.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 行动 - 生化人爱丽丝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's move. - Project Alice, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.09,0:33:37.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都会死在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're all going to die down here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.93,0:33:40.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,早听你说过了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've heard that before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.91,0:34:03.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,防御队形{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Defensive formation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.87,0:34:05.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,锁定目标{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mark your targets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.21,0:34:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,随时开火{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire at will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.89,0:34:26.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,前方就是潜艇船坞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Submarine pens are up ahead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.69,0:34:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴里 你我当前锋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barry, you and I take point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.77,0:34:35.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,30分钟后与爱丽丝和艾达会合{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We rendezvous with Alice and Ada in 30 minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.04,0:34:54.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.55,0:35:03.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可是个大家伙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, that's some hardware.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.35,0:35:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,台风级的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Typhoon class.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.85,0:35:07.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏俄迄今最大的核潜艇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The biggest nuclear subs the Soviets ever built.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.93,0:35:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护伞用它向世界各地私运生化武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Umbrella used them to secretly transport bioweapons all over the globe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.27,0:35:15.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得快点 只有不到90分钟了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's pick up the pace. We have less than 90 minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.23,0:35:17.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,发现入侵者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Intruders detected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.19,0:35:19.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,锁定目标将其消灭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Targeted for termination.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.49,0:35:25.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,纽约{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}New York.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.33,0:35:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,逃生还要再通过两个测试环境{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to cross two more test environments to escape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.21,0:35:29.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,行动吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.08,0:35:32.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护伞为什么还做这些测试？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would Umbrella continue to run these tests?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.42,0:35:35.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们想研究生化危机 想知道怎么控制它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They want to study the biohazard, learn how to control it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.05,0:35:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,启动纽约序列{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Initialize New York sequence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.97,0:35:41.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,激活生化危机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Activate biohazard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.10,0:35:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,已就绪 已就绪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand by. Stand by.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.14,0:35:51.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,纽约序列启动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}New York sequence initialized.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.39,0:35:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,红后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Red Queen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.40,0:35:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,她要激活生化武器阻止我们 行动吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's activating bioweapons to stop us. Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.98,0:35:57.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.15,0:35:59.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听到了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hear that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.62,0:36:09.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道是什么吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what it is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.33,0:36:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个主意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have an idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.43,0:36:32.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,开什么玩笑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have got to be kidding me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.95,0:38:07.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,傻大个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, boys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.41,0:38:10.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这办法够狠{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.55,0:38:31.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.22,0:38:34.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们比计划晚了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're behind schedule.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.28,0:38:48.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么情况？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.99,0:38:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,模拟序列已结束{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the end of the sequence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.37,0:38:53.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,很少能超过一小时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They rarely last more than an hour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.66,0:38:54.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.04,0:38:58.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,趁红后还没激活其它武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before the Red Queen activates something else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.87,0:39:02.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,目标存活{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Targets survived.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.25,0:39:05.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,安保主管瓦伦丁负责拦截{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Security Chief Valentine to intercept.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.71,0:39:08.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,入侵者进入莫斯科测试环境{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Intruders entering Moscow test environment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.93,0:39:11.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,激活不死者罗斯·普拉格斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Activate Las Plagas Undead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.98,0:39:23.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.61,0:39:27.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,红后知道我们在这里 提高警惕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Red Queen knows we're here. Keep your eyes open.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.28,0:39:30.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,已就绪 已就绪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand by. Stand by.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.03,0:39:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫斯科序列启动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moscow sequence initialized.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.50,0:39:40.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了？ - 听{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Listen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.21,0:39:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.22,0:39:58.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么鬼东西？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are those things?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.27,0:40:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,后撤 全部后撤{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fall back. Everyone fall back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.55,0:40:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,是云吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clouds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.67,0:40:32.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,假的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not real.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.34,0:40:34.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,是全息投影{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a holographic projection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.55,0:40:37.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,运行模拟影像时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When they were running a simulation, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.81,0:40:41.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人会朝天上看 相信我吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}trust me, no one was looking at the sky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.77,0:40:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是会合地点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the rendezvous point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.32,0:40:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,突击队来晚了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The strike team is late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.61,0:40:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.28,0:40:57.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你背后房子有人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's movement in the house behind you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.03,0:40:59.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面的窗子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Upstairs window.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.23,0:41:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们怎么在这里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would they be in here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.95,0:41:35.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,借用我的克隆体{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're using clones of me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.45,0:41:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.87,0:41:40.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是50个基础样本之一{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were one of the 50 basic models.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.08,0:41:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,基础样本{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Basic models."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.50,0:41:48.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然保护伞怎么在测试场景安插居民呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you think Umbrella populates these test scenarios?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.33,0:41:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次模拟演示都要死好几百人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hundreds of people dead each time they run a simulation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.88,0:41:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护伞向他们植入一些基础记忆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Umbrella imprints them with basic memories, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.13,0:42:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚够其对生化危机做出正常情绪反应{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}just enough to ensure a correct emotional response to the threat of the biohazard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.68,0:42:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次测试她可能是个郊区家庭主妇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In one life, she could be a suburban housewife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.56,0:42:05.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,下次就可能是纽约的商人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The next, a businesswoman in New York.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.10,0:42:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,再下次又可能是保护伞的打手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The next, a soldier working for Umbrella.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.48,0:43:30.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.15,0:43:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我按你说的藏起来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hid like you told me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.61,0:43:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你衣服和发型怎么变了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to your clothes and your hair?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.74,0:44:27.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,火箭弹 卧倒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}RPG! Down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.00,0:44:33.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们快没时间了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're running out of time!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.00,0:44:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得赶紧找条突围路线{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to find us a way out now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.84,0:44:38.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Almost there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.98,0:44:58.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这都是假的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of this is real.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.98,0:45:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可对她是真的 - 这个我理解{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It is to her. - I know. That's the point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.28,0:45:06.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,她对你的所有感情都是植入的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All these feelings she has for you, they were imprinted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.53,0:45:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,一天前 她还是白纸一张{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A day ago, she was a blank slate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.79,0:45:14.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷库里我可以给你找到一打的她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could show you a dozen just like her in cold storage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.13,0:45:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 但这是事实{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, but it's true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.50,0:45:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.67,0:45:22.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很快吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was fast, wasn't I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.42,0:45:23.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, you were.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.16,0:45:54.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爸爸 - 他不是你爸爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Daddy? - He's not your father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.04,0:45:56.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,能抓就抓{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Capture if possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.79,0:45:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行就杀掉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Terminate if necessary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.46,0:46:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里可有孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a child here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.30,0:46:04.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是你的事 与我们无关{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your problem, not ours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.84,0:46:08.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,心如铁石 你一点也没变{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All heart. You haven't changed a bit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.18,0:46:10.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不认识你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know you, lady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.39,0:46:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不投降就去死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, surrender or die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.32,0:46:27.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,蹲下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.95,0:47:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- B组冲上去 - 好的 长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Advance in teams! - Yes, ma'am!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.38,0:47:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能待在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't stay here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.67,0:47:26.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个会告诉你怎么出去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This will show you the way out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.13,0:47:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿过莫斯科 去潜艇船坞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go through Moscow to the submarine pens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.82,0:47:30.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.09,0:47:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最好轻装上阵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The less I have with me, the better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.81,0:47:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,A组推进{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alpha Team forward!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.00,0:48:01.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们来了 我们得快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're coming. Hurry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.79,0:48:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.09,0:48:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到路了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.97,0:48:54.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.94,0:49:04.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.06,0:49:05.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.11,0:49:08.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,她帮过我们 记得吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She helped us. Remember?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.77,0:49:09.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你俩没死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two made it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.74,0:49:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为自己是唯一的幸存者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought I was the only one that survived.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.03,0:49:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是哪儿？怎么都标的俄语？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this place, and why is everything in Russian?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.12,0:49:21.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这副性虐装扮又是怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what's with the S & M getup?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.58,0:49:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你知道怎么用吗？ - 我支持禁枪的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You know how to use this? - I campaigned for gun control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.67,0:49:30.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不明白 我还抗议过美国枪械协会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I don't think you understand. I marched against the NRA.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.88,0:49:32.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,听好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Concentrate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.09,0:49:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就像个相机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just like a camera.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.05,0:49:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞄准 射击{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Point and shoot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.43,0:49:45.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜 你正式成为坏人了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations. You're officially a badass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.69,0:49:49.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生什么事了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell's going on here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.86,0:49:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我回来解释{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll explain when I get back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.53,0:49:53.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你要保障她的安全{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to keep her safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.69,0:49:55.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你跟紧她 - 你要走？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You stay with her. - You're going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.03,0:49:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是说不离开我吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said you wouldn't leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.87,0:50:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 我不会骗你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me, okay? What I say is true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.53,0:50:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定回来接你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll come back for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.74,0:50:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你发誓{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You promise?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.20,0:50:04.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.96,0:50:11.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.17,0:50:14.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.84,0:50:17.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会回来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll be back for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.64,0:50:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,先找个地方藏起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotta find a hiding place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.85,0:50:21.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我遇到你姐姐了 - 什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I met your sister. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.10,0:50:24.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,她人不太好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's not very nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.60,0:50:27.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们藏下边去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's try hiding down here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.37,0:50:40.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.32,0:50:41.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,行动吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.12,0:50:44.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也许能绕过…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can work our way…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.56,0:51:13.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,还等我发邀请函吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Waiting for a written invitation?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.53,0:51:24.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,技术不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweet ride.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.08,0:51:27.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了 这是莫斯科{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, this is Moscow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.66,0:51:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听到了枪声 猜你们需要帮助{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heard gunfire. Thought you might need some help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.51,0:51:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾达在哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Ada?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.88,0:51:33.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think she made it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.71,0:51:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对不起 - 你看到她死了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm sorry. - You saw her die?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.13,0:51:38.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.63,0:51:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,她总有办法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She always has a plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.76,0:52:23.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥几个 动动手呗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boys, you mind?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.47,0:52:25.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那打吧 - 乐意之至{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shall we? - My pleasure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.84,0:52:58.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,下次再这么干 请先吱一声{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me know when you plan on doing that again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.09,0:53:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,当心了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heads up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.63,0:53:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的小朋友又来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our little friend is back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.26,0:53:46.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.97,0:53:52.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快到了 - 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Almost there. - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.64,0:53:54.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢点 你要干什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. You're not going down there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.85,0:54:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都没事吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.73,0:54:40.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,还行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.81,0:54:41.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我们走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.78,0:54:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.82,0:54:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们出来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can come out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.70,0:54:51.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我回来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.54,0:54:58.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪儿找到这几位的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where'd you find these guys?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.00,0:55:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是…？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.46,0:55:02.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫贝姬{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Becky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.30,0:55:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 贝姬{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Becky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.71,0:55:06.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我妈妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my mom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.47,0:55:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你妈妈？ - 说来话长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your mom? Mm. - Long story.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.64,0:55:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有22分钟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twenty-two minutes left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.06,0:55:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,来的路没法走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no going back the way we came.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.70,0:55:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 跟那帮谢尔盖打时把地图丢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. We lost our map with Sergei.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.60,0:55:19.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有办法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.87,0:55:34.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以走这条地道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can take this tunnel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.45,0:55:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽头有个竖井直通潜艇船坞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a service shaft that leads down to the submarine pens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.12,0:55:39.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.86,0:56:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么不给威斯克干了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you end up working for Wesker?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.07,0:56:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不为他工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't work for him, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.82,0:56:10.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面情况有变{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but things on the surface have changed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.16,0:56:13.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,威斯克说你熟悉一样武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wesker said you knew of some weapon, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.49,0:56:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,某种能让我们扭转局势的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}something that could turn the tide for us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.20,0:56:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不可能为一个人冒那么大风险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I don't think I would have risked so much for one person.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.29,0:56:23.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,算你判断正确{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're probably right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.08,0:56:25.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.30,0:56:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,潜艇船坞就在我们上面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The submarine pens are up above us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.51,0:56:30.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟紧点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.44,0:56:53.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,升降机平台就在前面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The elevator platforms are up ahead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.49,0:56:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,还剩11分钟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eleven minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.16,0:56:57.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们来得及 - 等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're gonna be okay. - Hold on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.33,0:57:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还剩11分钟 - 我们来得及{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Eleven minutes. - We're gonna be okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.29,0:57:05.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等等 - 接入电力网{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hold on. - Accessing power grid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.29,0:57:07.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,安排生化危机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dispatching biohazard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.88,0:57:14.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家快登艇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody get on board.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.26,0:57:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位请扶好 下一站是男装及体育用品商店{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on. Next stop, menswear and sporting goods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.28,0:57:31.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,蹲下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.65,0:57:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 巴里 怎么回事？ - 我不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Barry, what is it? - I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.49,0:57:36.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.57,0:57:38.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,定是有人远程切断了电源{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody must've cut the power remotely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.70,0:57:43.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,坚强些{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be strong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.58,0:57:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会保护你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna keep you safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.30,0:57:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,能在线重连吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you get it online?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.47,0:57:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,没密码可不行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not without the access codes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.89,0:58:05.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,9分钟 看来要选备用方案了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nine minutes. Looks like we're going with plan B.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.35,0:58:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.69,0:58:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些爆炸物不是随便安置的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a reason we planted those explosives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.82,0:58:19.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.87,0:58:25.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.58,0:58:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah! Mommy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.09,0:58:37.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不行了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel like shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.56,0:58:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,她死定了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.07,0:58:54.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你干什么？ - 她还活着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you doing? - She's alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.44,0:58:55.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去救她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to get her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.82,0:58:57.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没失去过这么多朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't lose friends{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.28,0:59:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你就这么走了 - 我会回来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- so you could walk away. - I plan on coming back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.74,0:59:03.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.24,0:59:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你比她重要多了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're more important than she is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.33,0:59:07.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这就错了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's where you're wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.41,0:59:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样真不行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a mistake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.25,0:59:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,请让开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of my way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.26,0:59:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我回来前别走 好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't leave without me, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.26,0:59:24.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,开什么玩笑？我跟你一起去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you kidding me? I'm going with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.90,0:59:33.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动 别动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't move. Don't move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.73,0:59:34.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.53,0:59:36.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,去找孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go get her back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.01,1:00:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,就喜欢挨枪子儿吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You like that? Huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.91,1:01:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,前进{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.21,1:01:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,回升降机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fall back to the elevator!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.71,1:01:57.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你先去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.67,1:01:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再撑会儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna stay a while.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.09,1:02:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.67,1:02:04.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,等倒计时归零{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the countdown gets down to zero, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.17,1:02:06.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须进到升降机里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you have to be on that elevator!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.26,1:02:07.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,里昂 得有人守在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone's got to stay.Leon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.01,1:02:09.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.31,1:02:15.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这会儿我杀得正爽{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm kind of enjoying myself!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.52,1:02:21.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go. Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.82,1:02:24.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.61,1:03:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝姬 贝姬{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Becky. Becky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.05,1:04:07.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.82,1:04:35.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,带俘虏出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring out the prisoner!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.38,1:04:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,敢开枪 我就杀了她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cease your firing. Or I'll execute her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.22,1:04:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下枪 走出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, throw down your guns, and step out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.97,1:04:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不出来她就死定了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Step out, or she dies!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.18,1:06:20.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 她们是谁啊？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy, who are they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.77,1:06:27.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 他们是谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy, Who are they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.19,1:06:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 那是你吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy, is that you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.96,1:06:48.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你才是我妈妈 对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're my mommy, aren't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.83,1:06:50.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.65,1:07:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.76,1:09:04.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,直升机正赶过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Choppers are on their way, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.39,1:09:07.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,都好好喘口气吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so just sit back and relax.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.51,1:09:41.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.18,1:09:53.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.15,1:10:05.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝姬 你受伤了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Becky, are you hurt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.70,1:10:07.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I'm okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.28,1:11:28.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你说她有办法的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Told you she'd have a plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.87,1:11:34.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有你们两个？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only the two of you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.66,1:11:36.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个就够了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll be enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.25,1:11:43.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗斯·普拉格斯的寄生体{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Las Plagas parasite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.88,1:16:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,消灭生化人爱丽丝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Terminate Project Alice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.87,1:19:14.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱丽丝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alice!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.14,1:19:32.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀不死我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't kill me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.93,1:19:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不需要杀你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't need to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.48,1:20:21.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要杀了你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming for you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.77,1:20:23.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你好运{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck with that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.97,1:20:51.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,里昂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.10,1:21:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.52,1:21:07.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,援兵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.26,1:22:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你苏醒了真好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glad to have you back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.50,1:22:20.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你苏醒了真好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glad to have you back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.30,1:22:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不管{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.83,1:23:28.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,威斯克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wesker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.67,1:23:31.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你倒悠闲自在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see you've made yourself at home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.75,1:23:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 我是挺放松的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I must say, it does have a certain ease to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.52,1:23:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么？你给我注射了什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this? What have you done to me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.57,1:24:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你曾是唯一与T病毒成功结合的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were the only one to successfully bond with the T-Virus, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.74,1:24:07.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了发挥她的最大威力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to fully realize her powers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.91,1:24:09.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我需要你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, now I have need of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.04,1:24:11.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前的你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The old you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.13,1:24:14.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以把超能力还给你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I've given you back your gift.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.88,1:24:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are the weapon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.56,1:24:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要杀了你 - 也许{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm gonna kill you. - Perhaps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.39,1:24:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,但首先你得完成任务{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But first, you have work to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.23,1:24:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,红后要毁灭地球上所有生命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Red Queen is determined to destroy all life on earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.57,1:24:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们人类仅存的生命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the last that remain of us, of the human race.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.53,1:24:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们似乎应该同仇敌忾{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seems we're bonded against a common foe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.37,1:24:52.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是要你回来的原因 成为终极武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is why we needed you back. The ultimate weapon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.71,1:25:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是人类的背水之战{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is humanity's last stand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.84,1:25:03.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,终结的起始{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The beginning of the end.{\r}
